0 Ellipsa — one-motor ellipsograph
0 Name: ellipsa.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under the BSD-3-Clause license; see ../licenses/ellipsa.txt.
0 // Original native arrangement. One motor on hub port A rides the X carriage.
0 // Two perpendicular sliders and two ordinary hinges produce a 3:1 ellipse.
0 // Every guide and shaft is physically retained; no output path is assigned.
0 // External standard part meshes are referenced, not embedded.
